msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE6"
msgid "BEAT THE HEAT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE6"
msgid ""
"At first, I was excited to get my tan on in this desert...but it's way too hot to be out in the sun "
"for long! I started getting burned almost instantly!!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE6_1"
msgid ""
"      Better stay in the shade, or wait to move until nightfall...but finding an umbrella or "
"something would be even better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE7"
msgid "HOLD YOUR BREATH..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE7"
msgid ""
"This may be the freakiest place we've found so far... just breathing around here makes my lungs "
"itchy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE7_1"
msgid ""
"      The mushrooms seem to subtly move on their own. Something tells me if anyone succumbs to "
"their spores, it might be a fate worse than death..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE8"
msgid "POISON IS BAD!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE8"
msgid ""
"      In this jungle, everything seems to be out to get us! Just touching some of these plants "
"causes painful, itchy sores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE8_1"
msgid ""
"      But don't worry! If you don't have an antidote on hand, certain herbs growing on the mountain "
"can help you deal with poison, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE9"
msgid "OUT OF THE FRYING PAN..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE9"
msgid ""
"      This is getting ridiculous! A single misstep, and I'll be a crispy scoutmaster! Did the rest "
"of the troop really make it through this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE9_1"
msgid "      On the bright side, I might not even need a campfire to make a home-cooked meal here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE10"
msgid "KEEP YOUR HEAD UP!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE10"
msgid ""
"      Something about this special fog is making me sleepy... I've gotta remember to get some fresh "
"air, or it could be lights out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE10_1"
msgid ""
"It looks like these towers have magical flame in them that burns the fog away. If only I could take "
"some of it with me..."
msgstr ""

